# Styling & UX

## UxStyle.md Required
- Each project defines `UxStyle.md` in repo root
- Sets UX style, branding, design patterns
- Changes reflected immediately in development
- Sections: color palette, typography, spacing, motion, accessibility

## Headers & Navigation
- Professional, intuitive, consistent with brand
- Brand mark visible across breakpoints
- Accessible mobile menu (right-side overlay)
- Keyboard support, smooth transitions

## No Browser Prompts
- Never use `alert()`, `confirm()`, `prompt()`
- Build branded modal component instead:
  - Matches design system and theme
  - Supports dark/light modes
  - Reusable for multiple use cases
  - Smooth animations, professional UX
  - Accessibility: focus management, keyboard nav, ARIA

## Design Direction
- Request style/UX clarification before defining design systems
